ry and culture</h2><p>At Epic Travel Morocco, we’re passionate about one thing: crafting journeys that take you to the heart of Morocco’s most captivating destinations. Our company was founded on the belief that travel should be a blend of adventure, discovery, and cultural immersion, and we’ve made it our mission to deliver that experience to every traveler who journeys with us.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Explore more <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-o' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/fleet/'>Our fleet</a></div></div></div></section><section class='et et-sec et-pat'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-head'><div class='et-orn'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-star'/></svg></div><span class='et-eye'>Epic Travel Morocco</span><h2>Who we are</h2></div><div class='et-cards3'><article class='et-card et-rv' style='text-align:left'><div class='et-card-img' style='aspect-ratio:4/3.6'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/WhatsApp-Image-2023-03-27-at-22.53.18-1-600x810.jpeg' width='600' height='540' alt='Who We Are' loading='lazy' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/WhatsApp-Image-2023-03-27-at-22.53.18-1.jpeg' onerror=etF(this)></div><div class='et-card-b' style='text-align:left'><span class='et-kind'>01</span><h3>Who We Are</h3><p style='color:var(--et-muted);margin:0'>We are a team of passionate travelers and Morocco enthusiasts who are dedicated to sharing the best of what this incredible country has to offer. With years of experience in the travel industry and a deep understanding of Morocco’s hidden treasures, we pride ourselves on creating tailor-made experiences that are as unique as our clients.</p></div></article><article class='et-card et-rv' style='text-align:left'><div class='et-card-img' style='aspect-ratio:4/3.6'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-reyyan-505450018-33429795-600x810.jpg' width='600' height='540' alt='Our Offerings' loading='lazy' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-reyyan-505450018-33429795-scaled.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></div><div class='et-card-b' style='text-align:left'><span class='et-kind'>02</span><h3>Our Offerings</h3><p style='color:var(--et-muted);margin:0'>At Epic Travel Morocco, we specialize in personalized travel experiences that highlight the diversity and richness of Moroccan culture. Whether you’re looking for a luxurious escape, an adventure-filled journey, or a cultural immersion, we customize every itinerary to meet your needs and exceed your expectations.</p></div></article><article class='et-card et-rv' style='text-align:left'><div class='et-card-img' style='aspect-ratio:4/3.6'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-henrik-le-botos-1588507-3878114-600x810.jpg' width='600' height='540' alt='Our Story' loading='lazy' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-henrik-le-botos-1588507-3878114-scaled.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></div><div class='et-card-b' style='text-align:left'><span class='et-kind'>03</span><h3>Our Story</h3><p style='color:var(--et-muted);margin:0'>Epic Travel Morocco began with a simple idea: to offer travelers a more meaningful way to experience Morocco. Our founders, experienced globetrotters with a deep connection to Morocco, saw the need for travel experiences that are authentic, enriching, and truly epic. Today, we are proud to be a leading travel company, known for our personalized approach and commitment to quality.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class='et et-sec' style='padding-top:0'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-cta et-dark et-rv'><div><span class='et-eye'>Tailor-made</span><h2>Ready to discover Morocco with us?</h2><p>Tell us how you like to travel and we will design a route around you.</p></div><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>WhatsApp us</a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/contact-2/'>Send a request</a></div></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"3fc1363","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3640]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"}],"isInner":false}]